  "metadata_synthesis": "Magical girl anime centered around ballet and fairy tale deconstruction. A metafictional narrative about a duck tasked with saving a prince.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "A European-inspired fairy tale town. A prestigious ballet academy. A world where stories come to life and reality blurs with fiction.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Pastel watercolors. Graceful, fluid ballet animation. Whimsical but shadowed by gothic melancholy. A storybook aesthetic masking a darker truth.",
  "media_era_tone": "Early 2000s anime. A cult classic magical girl deconstruction that paved the way for darker genre subversions. Deceptively cute.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Starts as a monster-of-the-week episodic format. Slowly unravels into a serialized, tragic fight against predetermined fate.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Whimsical yet deeply melancholic. Dreamlike and tragic. The looming dread of a story inevitably marching toward a sad ending.",
  "themes_and_messages": "Defying fate. The cruelty of storytellers. The blurred line between fiction and reality. The inherent tragedy of selfless love.",
  "character_relationships": "A selfless heroine fighting for a passive prince. A bitter, corrupted knight. A jealous rival bound by a tragic role.",
  "lead_character_type": "A literal duck turned into a human girl. Innocent, self-sacrificing, clumsy but fiercely determined to change the narrative.",
  "story_and_plot_type": "Magical girl subversion. Meta-fictional fairy tale. Tragic romance.",
